          "python",
          "B=0   B=1\n       +-----+-----+\n  A=0  |  0  |  1  |\n       +-----+-----+\n  A=1  |  1  |  1  |\n       +-----+-----+\n\nGroups:\n- Row A=1 (m2, m3): gives A\n- Column B=1 (m1, m3): gives B\n\nF = A + B"
